WEBVTT

00:07:57.389 --> 00:08:01.268
I mean, why do we only accept
chocolate and vanilla

00:08:01.268 --> 00:08:03.229
as ice cream flavors?

00:08:05.439 --> 00:08:08.275
I needed to come up
with something better, different.

00:08:08.984 --> 00:08:10.486
Push that boundary.

00:08:11.737 --> 00:08:15.241
I knew I had to come up
with a flavor of milk

00:08:15.241 --> 00:08:16.450
that was different.

00:08:16.492 --> 00:08:18.911
Milk is, like, the base
of any great ice cream.

00:08:19.787 --> 00:08:23.832
So I sat out inspiration
at my 24-hour bodega.

00:08:23.832 --> 00:08:25.251
Favorite place to go.

00:08:25.918 --> 00:08:27.503
Because that's where we all shop,

00:08:27.545 --> 00:08:29.713
that's where our simple
taste buds are formed,

00:08:29.755 --> 00:08:31.549
it's the flavors we know.